Package: waypaper
Architecture: all
# Upstream's install_requires, from Debian. imageio-ffmpeg only previews videos
# (mpvpaper backend), so it is a Suggests.
Depends: python3 (>= 3.11),
         python3-gi,
         gir1.2-gtk-3.0,
         python3-pil,
         python3-imageio,
         python3-platformdirs,
         python3-screeninfo,
         swaybg,
         ${misc:Depends}
Suggests: python3-imageio-ffmpeg
Description: GUI wallpaper setter for Wayland
 Waypaper shows the images of a folder as thumbnails and sets the one you
 click as the wallpaper with swaybg (or swww, hyprpaper, mpvpaper and
 other backends). It remembers the choice and restores it at login with
 waypaper --restore.
 .
 This is upstream waypaper, packaged for FlickOS. It reads default
 settings from /etc/xdg/waypaper/config.ini (FlickOS wallpapers, swaybg,
 Arc-Dark background color) before the user's ~/.config/waypaper/config.ini.
